 "id": "seg5",
 "title": "签名的陷阱",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 177.38,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "字段齐了，验签的代码，还有三个经典陷阱。",
   "spoken": "字段齐了，验签的代码，还有三个经典陷阱。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.392,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 5.162
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "第一，ecrecover 遇到无效签名，不会报错，而是返回零地址。",
   "spoken": "第一，ecrecover 遇到无效签名，不会报错，而是返回零地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-01.mp3",
   "start": 6.212,
   "dur": 5.928,
   "speechStart": 6.31,
   "speechEnd": 11.322
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "如果管理员地址没有初始化，它默认就是零。任何一个无效签名，都能通过。",
   "spoken": "如果管理员地址没有初始化，它默认就是零。任何一个无效签名，都能通过。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-02.mp3",
   "start": 12.36,
   "dur": 7.392,
   "speechStart": 12.458,
   "speechEnd": 18.908
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "第二，签名可塑性：同一条消息，存在两份都有效的签名。",
   "spoken": "第二，签名可塑性：同一条消息，存在两份都有效的签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-03.mp3",
   "start": 19.972,
   "dur": 5.832,
   "speechStart": 20.07,
   "speechEnd": 24.962
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "如果合约拿签名本身，标记已使用，翻转签名里的一个数值，就成了一份新签名。",
   "spoken": "如果合约拿签名本身，标记已使用，翻转签名里的一个数值，就成了一份新签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-04.mp3",
   "start": 26.024,
   "dur": 6.816,
   "speechStart": 26.122,
   "speechEnd": 32.003
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "修复是，用 nonce 或消息哈希做标记，再用拒绝这种翻转的库，比如 OpenZeppelin 的 ECDSA。",
   "spoken": "修复是，用 nonce 或消息哈希做标记，再用拒绝这种翻转的库，比如 OpenZeppelin 的 ECDSA。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-05.mp3",
   "start": 33.06,
   "dur": 8.328,
   "speechStart": 33.158,
   "speechEnd": 40.562
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "第三，编码碰撞。紧凑编码会把相邻的动态数据，直接拼在一起。",
   "spoken": "第三，编码碰撞。紧凑编码会把相邻的动态数据，直接拼在一起。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-06.mp3",
   "start": 41.608,
   "dur": 6.6,
   "speechStart": 41.706,
   "speechEnd": 47.358
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "ab 加 c，和 a 加 bc，结果完全相同。签多个动态类型时，用标准编码。",
   "spoken": "ab 加 c，和 a 加 bc，结果完全相同。签多个动态类型时，用标准编码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-07.mp3",
   "start": 48.428,
   "dur": 7.68,
   "speechStart": 48.526,
   "speechEnd": 55.261
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "还有一点。合约钱包没有私钥，要用 ERC-1271 的接口校验，不能只靠 ecrecover。",
   "spoken": "还有一点。合约钱包没有私钥，要用 ERC-1271 的接口较验，不能只靠 ecrecover。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-08.mp3",
   "start": 56.328,
   "dur": 7.392,
   "speechStart": 56.426,
   "speechEnd": 62.899
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "再看 permit 的两面。",
   "spoken": "再看 permit 的两面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-09.mp3",
   "start": 63.94,
   "dur": 2.28,
   "speechStart": 64.038,
   "speechEnd": 65.371
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "一面是抢跑型的拒绝服务。你提交的交易里，带着 permit 签名。",
   "spoken": "一面是抢跑型的拒绝服务。你提交的交易里，带着 permit 签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-10.mp3",
   "start": 66.44,
   "dur": 5.712,
   "speechStart": 66.538,
   "speechEnd": 71.309
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "别人从内存池复制这份签名，抢先单独提交。你的交易因为 nonce 已用，回滚。",
   "spoken": "别人从内存池复制这份签名，抢先单独提交。你的交易因为 nonce 已用，回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-11.mp3",
   "start": 72.372,
   "dur": 8.04,
   "speechStart": 72.47,
   "speechEnd": 79.586
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "修复是，把 permit 包在 try catch 里。失败后，检查授权额度是否已经足够。",
   "spoken": "修复是，把 permit 包在 try catch 里。失败后，检查授权额度是否已经足够。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-12.mp3",
   "start": 80.632,
   "dur": 7.44,
   "speechStart": 80.73,
   "speechEnd": 87.215
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "另一面是钓鱼。permit 在链下签，不花 gas，钱包常常只显示一串十六进制。",
   "spoken": "另一面是钓鱼。permit 在链下签，不花 gas，钱包常常只显示一串十六进制。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-13.mp3",
   "start": 88.292,
   "dur": 7.752,
   "speechStart": 88.39,
   "speechEnd": 95.197
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "签下之后，对方可以随时拿去执行。",
   "spoken": "签下之后，对方可以随时拿去执行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-14.mp3",
   "start": 96.264,
   "dur": 3.816,
   "speechStart": 96.362,
   "speechEnd": 99.231
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "签名再安全，签名人也可能签错东西。",
   "spoken": "签名再安全，签名人也可能签错东西。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-15.mp3",
   "start": 100.3,
   "dur": 3.984,
   "speechStart": 100.398,
   "speechEnd": 103.445
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "2025 年 2 月，交易所 Bybit 的冷钱包多签被盗。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 2 月，交易所 Bybit 的冷钱包多签被盗。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-16.mp3",
   "start": 104.504,
   "dur": 4.536,
   "speechStart": 104.602,
   "speechEnd": 108.221
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "按 Sygnia、Verichains 等公开分析，攻击者篡改了 Safe Wallet 的前端，只对 Bybit 的多签地址生效。",
   "spoken": "按 Sygnia、Verichains 等公开分析，攻击者篡改了 Safe Wallet 的前端，只对 Bybit 的多签地址生效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-17.mp3",
   "start": 109.26,
   "dur": 8.208,
   "speechStart": 109.358,
   "speechEnd": 116.619
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-18",
   "text": "签名人看到的，是一笔普通转账。",
   "spoken": "签名人看到的，是一笔普通转账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-18.mp3",
   "start": 117.688,
   "dur": 3.456,
   "speechStart": 117.786,
   "speechEnd": 120.298
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-19",
   "text": "实际签下的，是一次 delegatecall，把钱包的实现，换成恶意合约。",
   "spoken": "实际签下的，是一次 delegatecall，把钱包的实现，换成恶意合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-19.mp3",
   "start": 121.364,
   "dur": 5.712,
   "speechStart": 121.462,
   "speechEnd": 126.223
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-20",
   "text": "多签合约只校验签名对不对、数量够不够。签名是真的，内容不是签名人以为的内容。",
   "spoken": "多签合约只较验签名对不对、数量够不够。签名是真的，内容不是签名人以为的内容。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-20.mp3",
   "start": 127.296,
   "dur": 7.92,
   "speechStart": 127.394,
   "speechEnd": 134.367
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-21",
   "text": "按事发时估值，损失约 15 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "按事发时估值，损失约 15 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-21.mp3",
   "start": 135.436,
   "dur": 4.056,
   "speechStart": 135.534,
   "speechEnd": 138.653
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-22",
   "text": "多签防的是一把私钥被盗，防不了所有签名人，看到同一个假界面。",
   "spoken": "多签防的是一把私钥被盗，防不了所有签名人，看到同一个假界面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-22.mp3",
   "start": 139.712,
   "dur": 6.144,
   "speechStart": 139.81,
   "speechEnd": 145.048
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-23",
   "text": "2024 年 7 月，印度交易所 WazirX 的多签冷钱包，也是这样。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 7 月，印度交易所 WazirX 的多签冷钱包，也是这样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg5-23.mp3",
   "start": 146.076,
   "dur": 6.024,
   "speechStart": 146.174,
   "speechEnd": 151.269
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-24",
   "text": "界面上是日常交易，硬件钱包签下的，却是升级多签的恶意数据。按公开分析，损失约 2.3 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "界面上是日常交易，硬件钱包签下的，却是升级多签的恶意数据。按公开分析，损失约 2.3 亿美元。",
